A solution of urease, an enzyme that catalyzes the hydrolysis of urea into ammonia and carbon dioxide, is mixed with a 0.01mM urea solution. The measured initial velocity for the urea decomposition was  $1\times10^{-3}$ mM/min. Calculate	the	maximum	velocity	of	the	enzymatic	reaction given that under the experimental conditions, $K_m$ was found to be 0.05mM. 
